<%- include('../fragments/header') %><main id="top"><p class="eyebrow">OUR STORY</p><h1>Small details.<br>Little joys.</h1><section class="info-grid" id="presentation"><div><h2>A place for something sweet</h2><p>Sweet Corner is a small imaginary bakery built around cakes, pastries and ice cream. Browse the range, explore ingredients and keep your favorites in your browser.</p></div><img class="about-image" src="<%= basePath %>/assets/images/tea.svg" alt="A freshly baked pastry"></section><section id="history"><h2>From a recipe to a little corner</h2><ol class="news-list"><li><h3>The first idea</h3><p>A handful of recipes and a welcoming place to share them.</p></li><li><h3>A growing collection</h3><p>Cakes, pastries and frozen treats, with clear ingredient information.</p></li><li><h3>Your own selection</h3><p>A catalog that lets you filter, compare and save the treats you like.</p></li></ol></section><section id="motivation"><h2>Good things, thoughtfully made</h2><p>A clear description, readable labels and a little personality make every visit easier.</p></section><section id="gallery"><h2>Our collection</h2><div class="gallery"><% for(const image of images) { %><figure><img src="<%= basePath %>/assets/images/<%= image.file %>-600.webp" alt="<%= image.caption %>" loading="lazy"><figcaption><%= image.caption %></figcaption></figure><% } %></div></section></main><%- include('../fragments/footer') %>
